                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I waited a year before trying this game again, to see if it got any better.\nHonestly I think it got worse   lol\n\nI load into the main menu, where the only options given to me are 3 modes and a settings menu.\nNo info given on what any mode does, the settings simply change display features (which change at random during gameplay)\nI load into mission mode, to find a resident evil 2 style home, that is designed by someons who loves railing, literally there are railings in places railings shouldnt be.\nI am eventually led to a room will an elevator, which starts automatically the moment you enter it, to another room with an annoying echo and ground sound effect, NO ceiling, a door that wont open, and the elevator wont budge.\n\nUninstalled the game again.",
